# Ignore organisations and repositories when listing issues / refreshing the dashboard.
# Copy this file to `ignore` (gitignored) and edit locally:
#   cp ignore.example ignore
#
# Lines starting with # are comments. Blank lines are ignored.
#
# Organisations: "OrgName", "OrgName/*", or a GitHub URL
#   e.g. my-org/*  https://github.com/my-org
# Repositories: "owner/repo" or a GitHub URL
#   e.g. owner/old-repo  https://github.com/owner/old-repo

# Organisations
# my-org/*

# Repositories
# owner/repo
